  "privacyShareBody": "When you post produce, signed-in users see your name, number and town so they can contact you. When you send an inquiry, the farmer sees your name and number. TIMBANG admins (agriculture office staff) have access for moderation. It is never shown to the public or to people who are not signed in.",
  "privacyKeepTitle": "How long we keep it",
  "privacyKeepBody": "For as long as your account is active. When you delete your account, we delete your profile, listings, photos, alerts and inquiries. Prices you reported stay so market data remains accurate, but they are no longer linked to you.",
  "privacyRightsTitle": "Your rights",
  "privacyRightsBody": "Under RA 10173 you have the right to be informed, to access your data, to correct it, to object, and to have it erased. In Profile you can view and copy all the data we hold about you, edit your name and town, and delete your account at any time.",
  "privacySecurityTitle": "How we protect it",
  "privacySecurityBody": "Connections are encrypted. Access is limited by strict security rules: you can only see your own data, and sensitive admin actions are recorded in an audit log. We do not use analytics that collect personal data.",
  "privacyContactTitle": "Contact",
  "privacyContactBody": "For privacy questions or complaints, contact the TIMBANG admin at your agriculture office, or the Project TIMBANG developer at Nueva Vizcaya State University, Bayombong. You may also file a complaint with the National Privacy Commission (privacy.gov.ph).",
